		(property "Description" "WeAct Studio PD Power Mini V1 Buck, 61 x 40mm. Input USB-C PD/QC or DC up to 24V; output 1-20V, 0.05-3A, plus 5V 0.3A on the header (vendor values). Pads 1-2 OUT-, 3-4 OUT+ (3.81mm pluggable terminal, top to bottom); pads 5-12 2 x 4 header, odd 5V, even G. UART on the USB-C data lines, no pad: DP = TX, DM = RX, 3.3V. 4 holes 2.1mm. Drawn from the WeAct board shape drawing."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(hide yes)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
